## Load Balancer in a DevOps Architecture

In a typical DevOps/cloud architecture, a load balancer can sit between users and the application infrastructure.

```text
                   Users
                     |
                     ▼
              Load Balancer
                     |
          ┌──────────┼──────────┐
          ▼          ▼          ▼
       Server 1   Server 2   Server 3
          |          |          |
          └──────────┼──────────┘
                     ▼
                 Database
```

In a containerized environment, the same concept can be used to distribute traffic across application workloads running on containers or Kubernetes.

